      "content": "but that's the thing, why does it matter if i'm breathing if nothing is actually happening? it's just constant noise and effort for no reason. it honestly feels like the most logical thing would be to just... stop. to just let the noise take over so i don't have to carry the weight of being nothing anymore. doesn't it seem kind of peaceful to just stop fighting the current?",
